body:
Hi,

I'm currently using a _searchBox_ and a _hits_ widget for a documentation search box.

Currently instantjs fires a search with an empty input on page load. It would be great to have some sort of switch or, even better, a **character threshold** parameter with a reasonable default value (_e.g. Don't fire a search request for less than three characters_) like Typeahead.js does.

A possible implementation could be adding a `minLength` parameter on the _searchBox_ widget:

``` javascript
search.addWidget({
  container: '#search-wrapper input',
  minLength: 3
});
```
